## Phase 2 Contribution

This issue enables **Phase 2: Empty World** by ensuring:
> "The world's inhabitants are ephemeral and leave no trace"

Travellers wander the empty world, bringing life and mystery. But they're transient—appearing near players, despawning when alone. This transience requires clean lifecycle management: spawn, wander, despawn, **cleanup**.

Without this fix, the "empty" world accumulates invisible debris. With it, the world truly resets—empty again, ready for the next wanderer.
